WEBVTT

00:15.100 --> 00:21.910
Kokoro no mori no naka kimi ni deau koto

00:15.100 --> 00:21.910
I was always dreaming of meeting you

00:16.100 --> 00:22.150
<b>Zettai Shonen</b>

00:21.910 --> 00:26.980
Itsumo yume mitetan da

00:21.910 --> 00:26.980
within my heart’s forest.

00:26.980 --> 00:33.120
Hikari no silhouette sono saki wo mezashite

00:26.980 --> 00:33.120
The silhouette of light guides the way.

00:33.120 --> 00:38.750
Itsuka ai ni furete mitai

00:33.120 --> 00:38.750
One day, I’d like to try and experience love.

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
Kimochi to kotoba niji to mizutamari

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
My feelings and words can be like rainbows and puddles.

00:44.460 --> 00:51.870
Omoiau yasashisa ga michibiku ashita he to

00:44.460 --> 00:51.870
The kindness we share will guide us into tomorrow.

00:51.870 --> 00:57.370
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru kara

00:51.870 --> 00:57.370
With only you here, I can become stronger.

00:57.370 --> 01:03.670
Sora takaku negai wo kanadeyou

00:57.370 --> 01:03.670
My wish will be granted in the heights of the sky.

01:03.670 --> 01:09.050
Nanika taisetsu ka wo miushinawanu you ni

01:03.670 --> 01:09.050
You won’t lose sight of something precious to you,

01:09.050 --> 01:18.320
Kitto motto kagayaku kara

01:09.050 --> 01:18.320
because I’m sure it’ll shine even brighter.

01:18.320 --> 01:23.770
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru no sa

01:18.320 --> 01:23.770
With only you here, I can become stronger.

01:23.770 --> 01:30.130
Ima dekiru koto kara hajimeyou

01:23.770 --> 01:30.130
Let’s start with what we can do right now.

01:30.130 --> 01:35.510
Mawarimichi demo ii jibun wo shinjite

01:30.130 --> 01:35.510
I don’t mind if we take a detour, 
as long as you believe in yourself.

01:35.510 --> 01:44.620
Kitto motto sono saki he to

01:35.510 --> 01:44.620
By doing that, I’m sure we can go even further.

01:57.870 --> 02:00.500
<b>Something lucky is supposed
to happen today.</b>

02:00.510 --> 02:02.040
<b>What do you think?</b>

02:08.150 --> 02:09.280
<b>I see.</b>

02:25.760 --> 02:27.770
<b>Good evening, Dosshiru.</b>

02:33.870 --> 02:35.770
<b>Okay, got it.</b>

02:35.770 --> 02:37.140
<b>I’ll tell him.</b>

02:50.260 --> 02:52.760
<b>Miku, you’re still awake?</b>

02:58.700 --> 03:00.630
<b>If you leave the door open,
we’ll get mosquitos in the house.</b>

03:00.630 --> 03:03.230
<b>Why don’t we go back inside?</b>

03:03.240 --> 03:04.740
<b>In a little bit.</b>

03:08.870 --> 03:10.910
<b>Can you see something again?</b>

03:10.910 --> 03:12.010
<b>I guess.</b>

03:25.820 --> 03:32.800
<b>The Night of the Third Promise</b>

03:45.340 --> 03:47.010
<b>I think this is a waste of time.</b>

03:47.010 --> 03:48.750
<b>Don’t say that so easily!</b>

03:48.750 --> 03:50.220
<b>There’s no doubt in my mind</b>

03:50.220 --> 03:53.950
<b>that I have a better chance of seeing Old Lady Okaka when I’m with you.</b>

03:58.890 --> 04:00.260
<b>What’s this?</b>

04:00.260 --> 04:01.530
<b><i>You’re</i> with him, too?</b>

04:01.530 --> 04:03.830
<b>What’s with that tone?</b>

04:15.010 --> 04:15.970
<b>Umm...</b>

04:18.080 --> 04:19.410
<b>Ryousuke, you’re in the way!</b>

04:20.210 --> 04:22.310
<b>What kind of relationship do you two...</b>

04:23.380 --> 04:25.080
<b>It’s nothing.</b>

04:25.720 --> 04:28.050
<b>I just have to talk to Ayumu about something.</b>

04:28.050 --> 04:29.090
<b>Come on.</b>

04:29.090 --> 04:31.060
<b>Is it just me, or do you two get along strangely well?</b>

04:31.060 --> 04:34.790
<b>Just cause we’re together doesn’t mean
“we get along strangely well,” right?</b>

04:34.790 --> 04:37.290
<b>Well, I get along pretty well with him.</b>

04:37.300 --> 04:38.530
<b>Not really.</b>

04:38.530 --> 04:42.030
<b>Aizawa. You know that’s not true.</b>

04:48.840 --> 04:50.140
<b>I’m gonna run for it.</b>

04:51.240 --> 04:52.340
<b>Oh, all right.</b>

04:55.810 --> 04:57.480
<b>Wait a sec!</b>

04:58.780 --> 04:59.480
<b>Hey!</b>

05:03.990 --> 05:05.420
<b>Hey, wait up!</b>

05:07.260 --> 05:08.930
<b>Why do they run...?</b>

05:10.730 --> 05:12.200
<b>Because they don’t like you.</b>

05:22.310 --> 05:23.870
<b>It’s such a shame.</b>

05:24.410 --> 05:25.580
<b>What is?</b>

05:32.450 --> 05:34.150
<b>I won’t tell you.</b>

06:00.710 --> 06:03.180
<b>So you’re being chased again today?</b>

06:03.180 --> 06:05.320
<b>By Sukawara this time.</b>

06:05.320 --> 06:08.750
<b>Sukawara Akira’s still coming around?</b>

06:08.750 --> 06:12.460
<b>More importantly, why is she chasing you around?</b>

06:12.460 --> 06:13.560
<b>Huh?</b>

06:14.860 --> 06:16.460
<b>You’re right, I wonder why...</b>

06:18.500 --> 06:20.300
<b>Because Aizawa said he was running for it...</b>

06:20.300 --> 06:22.700
<b>...I got caught up in the moment and
decided to run with him, but...</b>

06:22.700 --> 06:23.600
<b>Huh?</b>

06:23.600 --> 06:25.100
<b>I just don’t get you.</b>

06:25.100 --> 06:28.540
<b>So, what are you doing over here, Miyama?</b>

06:28.540 --> 06:31.810
<b>It’s almost lunchtime, so I was looking for Miku...</b>

06:31.810 --> 06:32.840
<b>Have you seen her?</b>

06:35.080 --> 06:36.510
<b>I left her behind!</b>

06:37.950 --> 06:42.520
<b>When Sukawara came, Miku was with us.</b>

06:42.520 --> 06:43.950
<b>Where?</b>

06:43.960 --> 06:45.360
<b>By the riverbank.</b>

06:45.360 --> 06:46.890
<b>Near that statue.</b>

06:46.890 --> 06:48.190
<b>I see.</b>

06:48.190 --> 06:49.020
<b>Thanks.</b>

07:25.230 --> 07:26.460
<b>Taruto.</b>

07:27.400 --> 07:28.860
<b>Come here.</b>

07:37.710 --> 07:40.340
<b>I wonder how Taku’s doing...</b>

07:41.980 --> 07:45.350
<b>I wonder if I should be the one to call him?</b>

07:53.050 --> 07:56.390
<b>I don’t know what to do...</b>

08:15.810 --> 08:16.980
<b>Taruto...</b>

08:23.520 --> 08:24.690
<b>Hello?</b>

08:24.690 --> 08:26.590
<b>Sorry for calling so suddenly.</b>

08:26.590 --> 08:28.120
<b>Are you free right now?</b>

08:28.120 --> 08:30.160
<b>Yes! Completely!</b>

08:30.160 --> 08:32.590
<b>I was actually feeling a little bored.</b>

08:32.590 --> 08:34.500
<b>You have good timing. Everything’s okay.</b>

08:34.500 --> 08:35.700
<b>Can you come out for a while?</b>

08:35.700 --> 08:37.870
<b>Sure... how far do I need to go?</b>

08:37.870 --> 08:39.470
<b>Look out your window.</b>

09:05.360 --> 09:06.460
<b>It’s for you, Ayumu.</b>

09:06.460 --> 09:07.430
<b>Okay.</b>

09:08.330 --> 09:08.930
<b>Hello?</b>

09:08.930 --> 09:09.960
<b>Aizawa?</b>

09:09.970 --> 09:11.970
<b>I’ll be waiting at Nekogatsuji Street
to look for the cat again at two.</b>

09:11.970 --> 09:13.530
<b>I’ll be counting on you!</b>

09:44.970 --> 09:46.200
<b>Crap!</b>

09:46.200 --> 09:47.700
<b>What are you doing?</b>

09:51.010 --> 09:52.140
<b>Huh?</b>

09:52.140 --> 09:53.770
<b>Ryousuke!</b>

10:01.920 --> 10:02.720
<b>That’s weird...</b>

10:11.790 --> 10:12.930
<b>Anyway, we’re going home.</b>

10:12.930 --> 10:14.200
<b>How?</b>

10:14.200 --> 10:15.730
<b>I’ll make it move with my spirit!</b>

10:15.730 --> 10:17.330
<b>Put your scooter in the back.</b>

10:17.330 --> 10:18.770
<b>You serious?</b>

10:25.810 --> 10:27.440
<b>Could it be the battery...?</b>

10:27.440 --> 10:28.980
<b>No, there’s no way it could be...</b>

10:44.290 --> 10:45.730
<b>What the...?</b>

10:45.730 --> 10:47.230
<b>You can sit back there!</b>

10:48.000 --> 10:50.200
<b>Because we’re going home like this!</b>

10:54.340 --> 10:55.140
<b>Aizawa!</b>

10:56.340 --> 10:58.110
<b>Sorry for calling you out.</b>

10:58.110 --> 11:00.640
<b>It looks like I’ve been caught today...</b>

11:00.640 --> 11:03.580
<b>...but let’s look for Old Lady Okaka
again some other time!</b>

11:04.980 --> 11:06.110
<b>I’ve been telling you...</b>

11:07.580 --> 11:09.550
<b>...look for her on your own.</b>

11:11.150 --> 11:14.360
<b>Don’t you feel like there’s some
kind of story behind this place?</b>

11:15.790 --> 11:17.530
<b>I dunno...</b>

11:17.530 --> 11:20.130
<b>There’s something here in this valley.</b>

11:20.130 --> 11:22.130
<b>There’s no doubt about that.</b>

11:24.670 --> 11:27.600
<b>And it’s not a ghost or something familiar like that.</b>

11:27.600 --> 11:30.440
<b>It’s more of a complete unknown...</b>

11:30.440 --> 11:32.170
<b>Have you seen it?</b>

11:32.170 --> 11:33.470
<b>Indirectly, I guess.</b>

11:35.210 --> 11:37.880
<b>It was reflected in a cat’s eyes.</b>

11:39.480 --> 11:40.280
<b>What was?</b>

11:46.760 --> 11:49.690
<b>I don’t know. 
That’s what I’m investigating.</b>

11:50.430 --> 11:52.430
<b>Do you have any ideas?</b>

11:54.000 --> 11:56.160
<b>No... I don’t.</b>

12:12.810 --> 12:16.180
<b>How much do you know?</b>

12:16.180 --> 12:16.880
<b>About what?</b>

12:17.520 --> 12:22.390
<b>Wakkun, Dosshiru, Shisshin and...</b>

12:22.390 --> 12:24.060
<b>...me.</b>

12:24.060 --> 12:25.890
<b>I don’t know all that much.</b>

12:25.890 --> 12:28.530
<b>I’ve only played with Wakkun once.</b>

12:28.530 --> 12:29.700
<b>When?</b>

12:29.700 --> 12:31.370
<b>Two years ago.</b>

12:31.370 --> 12:32.830
<b>When you went missing?</b>

12:34.000 --> 12:36.070
<b>So you heard from Miki-nee?</b>

12:36.070 --> 12:36.870
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:36.870 --> 12:40.170
<b>I didn’t really go missing... 
I was just playing.</b>

12:40.980 --> 12:42.340
<b>Huh? But...</b>

12:43.010 --> 12:46.550
<b>You went missing in the Touya Forest, right?</b>

12:46.550 --> 12:49.320
<b>That would mean Wakkun was in there, right?</b>

12:50.920 --> 12:51.890
<b>He was.</b>

12:51.890 --> 12:55.560
<b>But that night, we went back to the river...</b>

12:55.560 --> 12:57.320
<b>...and I haven’t seen him since.</b>

12:59.130 --> 13:04.430
<b>You said Wakkun was waiting for you,
and you were waiting for him, right?</b>

13:04.430 --> 13:05.600
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:05.600 --> 13:09.140
<b>I’m sure it was the same for me...</b>

13:10.240 --> 13:11.310
<b>Well...</b>

13:11.810 --> 13:13.310
<b>I don’t know.</b>

13:16.710 --> 13:18.280
<b>We’re alone.</b>

13:24.990 --> 13:26.750
<b>It’s all such a pain...</b>

13:26.760 --> 13:29.220
<b>School and friends...</b>

13:29.220 --> 13:32.890
<b>Even if you don’t go,
no one will say anything...</b>

13:32.890 --> 13:33.860
<b>Yeah...</b>

13:36.870 --> 13:37.700
<b>I’m going home.</b>

13:53.850 --> 13:57.320
<b>Excuse me! 
I’m here from the Miyama Store.</b>

14:00.120 --> 14:02.060
<b>Hey. Good work.</b>

14:02.060 --> 14:02.960
<b>Takkun.</b>

14:02.960 --> 14:05.030
<b>Are we your last delivery for the day?</b>

14:05.030 --> 14:08.000
<b>I’m not sure I’d call it the “last,”
since you’re the only one.</b>

14:12.200 --> 14:13.930
<b>Wanna go take a walk?</b>

14:13.940 --> 14:14.900
<b>But...</b>

14:14.900 --> 14:17.640
<b>I’ll be right back, so just wait here, okay?</b>

14:34.360 --> 14:35.190
<b>Wait!</b>

14:43.200 --> 14:45.500
<b>Hang out with me for a while, Ayumu.</b>

14:45.500 --> 14:46.100
<b>Why?</b>

14:46.100 --> 14:49.170
<b>C’mon, it’ll be fine! I’m in the mood
to hang out with someone.</b>

14:49.170 --> 14:50.070
<b>Hey, quit it...</b>

14:53.510 --> 14:55.080
<b>I forgot to tell him.</b>

14:57.110 --> 14:59.980
<b>So you decided on your costume for the Cat Dance?</b>

14:59.980 --> 15:00.950
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:00.950 --> 15:02.220
<b>Er, how did you know?</b>

15:02.220 --> 15:05.450
<b>I heard from Unno that you bought the cloth for it.</b>

15:06.320 --> 15:07.560
<b>I see.</b>

15:07.560 --> 15:09.190
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:09.190 --> 15:12.160
<b>We did see each other on the bus the other day.</b>

15:21.670 --> 15:23.640
<b>What are you looking at?</b>

15:23.640 --> 15:24.810
<b>Ah, nothing...</b>

15:25.710 --> 15:28.240
<b>I was just thinking that your hair is really pretty.</b>

15:32.910 --> 15:35.920
<b>Hey... why haven’t you called me at all?</b>

15:35.920 --> 15:37.150
<b>Why?</b>

15:37.150 --> 15:37.920
<b>No reason, really.</b>

15:38.620 --> 15:42.060
<b>I saw something pretty unusual,
so I thought I’d tell you...</b>

15:46.030 --> 15:46.790
<b>What?</b>

15:46.800 --> 15:48.700
<b>Do you want to know?</b>

15:48.700 --> 15:50.330
<b>No... never mind.</b>

15:52.330 --> 15:54.270
<b>Why?! Geez!</b>

15:55.100 --> 15:57.100
<b>Have you heard that up the Nakizawagawa River...</b>

15:57.110 --> 16:00.910
<b>...there are supposed to be things
flying around that aren’t fireflies?</b>

16:00.910 --> 16:03.040
<b>I think I might’ve seen one.</b>

16:05.250 --> 16:07.520
<b>Did you go up the Nakizawagawa River?</b>

16:08.750 --> 16:09.950
<b>Nope.</b>

16:12.050 --> 16:14.760
<b>I saw it in EmeLan...</b>

16:14.760 --> 16:17.690
<b>You sure it wasn’t a car’s headlights or something?</b>

16:17.690 --> 16:18.960
<b>It wasn’t!</b>

16:18.960 --> 16:20.930
<b>I even know its true form.</b>

16:24.000 --> 16:27.000
<b>At first, it just looks like
a ball of light, but...</b>

16:27.000 --> 16:30.070
<b>...it was clearly reflected in Taruto’s eyes.</b>

16:30.070 --> 16:31.640
<b>And I saw it.</b>

16:31.640 --> 16:33.040
<b>What did it look like?</b>

16:33.810 --> 16:35.080
<b>So you do want to know?</b>

16:35.840 --> 16:37.040
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:50.130 --> 16:51.390
<b>Takkun.</b>

16:51.890 --> 16:53.730
<b>Ah, sorry.</b>

16:53.730 --> 16:55.130
<b>I was walking too fast.</b>

16:55.930 --> 16:57.830
<b>You need to keep things like this precious to you.</b>

16:59.200 --> 17:00.800
<b>I’m talking about Unno.</b>

17:00.800 --> 17:02.040
<b>Unno is...</b>

17:11.010 --> 17:12.550
<b>Why...?</b>

17:21.760 --> 17:22.790
<b>Well then, I’ll be–</b>

17:24.330 --> 17:26.060
<b>Ayumu, let’s go!</b>

17:30.470 --> 17:33.230
<b>Miyama, you’re the <i>worst</i>.</b>

17:33.240 --> 17:35.540
<b>Unno! It’s not like that!</b>

17:37.010 --> 17:38.270
<b>It’s fine.</b>

17:39.240 --> 17:41.440
<b>It’s not something you need to worry about.</b>

17:41.440 --> 17:42.610
<b>Let her be.</b>

17:44.950 --> 17:46.680
<b>But...</b>

18:03.430 --> 18:04.670
<b>Is this really all right?</b>

18:10.870 --> 18:12.570
<b>There’s no way it is...</b>

18:14.410 --> 18:16.440
<b>There’s no way it’s all right, but...</b>

18:17.610 --> 18:20.880
<b>...I couldn’t do anything but this...</b>

18:27.160 --> 18:29.560
<b>I’m sorry... I’m going home.</b>

18:47.680 --> 18:48.740
<b>Ayumu.</b>

18:48.740 --> 18:50.140
<b>I’m home.</b>

18:50.150 --> 18:53.310
<b>Miyama-san’s daughter called for you earlier.</b>

18:54.850 --> 18:56.480
<b>What are you so surprised about?</b>

18:56.490 --> 18:57.320
<b>Which one?</b>

18:57.320 --> 19:00.120
<b>The younger one, I think.</b>

19:00.120 --> 19:01.560
<b>Okay.</b>

19:01.560 --> 19:03.290
<b>Do you two get along well?</b>

19:03.290 --> 19:05.630
<b>Do those kinds of things concern you?</b>

19:05.630 --> 19:07.800
<b>Well, it was just a general comment.</b>

19:07.800 --> 19:09.160
<b>But there’s another side, too.</b>

19:09.160 --> 19:13.300
<b>I’m sure your mother would be happy
seeing you, make more friends.</b>

19:14.240 --> 19:16.270
<b>That’s not what I meant...</b>

19:22.040 --> 19:24.310
<b>Hello? This is the Miyama Store.</b>

19:24.310 --> 19:25.350
<b>Umm...</b>

19:26.520 --> 19:28.220
<b>This is Aizawa.</b>

19:28.220 --> 19:31.890
<b>Ah, umm... about before...</b>

19:31.890 --> 19:34.290
<b>I heard your little sister called when I was out...</b>

19:34.290 --> 19:37.220
<b>Miku did? Hold on a sec.</b>

19:37.230 --> 19:39.430
<b>Did you call Aizawa-kun earlier?</b>

19:39.430 --> 19:40.530
<b>Switch with me.</b>

19:41.800 --> 19:43.160
<b>Hello?</b>

19:43.170 --> 19:45.030
<b>So why’d you call?</b>

19:46.570 --> 19:49.070
<b>There was something I forgot to tell you.</b>

19:49.070 --> 19:51.170
<b>Dosshiru wanted me to give you a message.</b>

19:51.170 --> 19:53.040
<b>Message?</b>

19:53.040 --> 19:55.680
<b>“He’s waiting, even now.”</b>

19:55.680 --> 19:58.650
<b>“Wakkun’s waiting where he always is.”</b>

19:58.650 --> 19:59.650
<b>He’s not mad?</b>

20:00.880 --> 20:02.120
<b>You’re such a dummy.</b>

20:02.120 --> 20:04.990
<b>He wouldn’t be waiting for you if he was mad, right?</b>

20:04.990 --> 20:05.620
<b>Bye now.</b>

20:06.150 --> 20:09.460
<b>Hey... just what kind of relationship do you two have?</b>

20:11.860 --> 20:13.190
<b>I guess we’re “school-skipping buddies.”</b>

20:13.200 --> 20:15.600
<b>Huh? Miku, wait a sec!</b>

20:37.590 --> 20:38.690
<b>What?</b>

20:40.220 --> 20:42.390
<b>You’re going to guide me?</b>

21:07.950 --> 21:08.780
<b>There he is.</b>

21:20.660 --> 21:21.830
<b>Amu!</b>

21:23.030 --> 21:24.100
<b>About the other day...</b>

21:24.100 --> 21:25.400
<b>I got to see you again tonight!</b>

21:25.400 --> 21:26.900
<b>It’s okay!</b>

21:26.900 --> 21:28.040
<b>But...</b>

21:28.040 --> 21:29.140
<b>Amu...</b>

21:30.040 --> 21:31.610
<b>Let’s make a promise.</b>

21:31.610 --> 21:32.770
<b>To do what?</b>

21:32.770 --> 21:36.540
<b>Play with me on the night of the Cat Dance.</b>

21:38.610 --> 21:40.010
<b>Play with me...</b>

21:41.750 --> 21:43.350
<b>...please.</b>

21:46.390 --> 21:48.360
<b>Okay. I’ll play with you.</b>

21:50.490 --> 21:51.630
<b>Promise!</b>

21:51.630 --> 21:52.760
<b>Okay.</b>

22:01.040 --> 22:03.200
<b>The third time’s a charm.</b>

22:03.910 --> 22:05.810
<b>Did I mess up the saying?</b>

22:05.810 --> 22:08.480
<b>With the last one and tonight... that only makes two...</b>

22:08.480 --> 22:10.140
<b>It’s the third one.</b>

22:10.150 --> 22:11.350
<b>Really?</b>

22:12.550 --> 22:17.220
<b>During the Cat Dance!</b>

22:17.220 --> 22:21.960
<b>Together with Amu during the Cat Dance!</b>

22:21.960 --> 22:26.560
<b>During the Cat Dance!</b>

22:35.840 --> 22:37.640
<b>So this makes the third one...</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
words that no one else knew.

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

24:19.980 --> 24:22.940
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:20.510 --> 24:23.750
<b>Old Lady Okaka, I guess you really like
playing with these cattails, huh?</b>

24:23.750 --> 24:24.610
<b>What?</b>

24:24.610 --> 24:28.880
<b>Don’t they say cats get the urge to cling to them and play with them when they see one?</b>

24:28.880 --> 24:31.650
<b>What’s up with that? Who said that?</b>

24:31.650 --> 24:32.590
<b>Mikoshiba-san did.</b>

24:32.590 --> 24:34.560
<b>Huh? Who’s Mikoshiba-san?</b>

24:34.560 --> 24:37.330
<b>There’s no way Mikoshiba-san would
say something like that.</b>

24:37.330 --> 24:40.630
<b>Those kinds of plants aren’t meant
for humans to play with as toys.</b>

24:40.630 --> 24:41.800
<b>What? Is that so?</b>

24:41.800 --> 24:43.360
<b>Hey, who’s Mikoshiba-san?</b>

24:43.370 --> 24:47.000
<b>And it’s weird to see kids teasing cats with those things nowadays anyway.</b>

24:47.000 --> 24:49.240
<b>Though they did it a lot in the past...</b>

24:49.240 --> 24:50.610
<b>So that’s how it is.
Anyway, next time will be...</b>

24:50.610 --> 24:52.340
<b>“The Space Between What You Remember
and What You’re Told.”</b>

24:52.340 --> 24:57.480
<b>Come on! Just tell me who Mikoshiba-san is!
I want to know!</b>

24:55.010 --> 24:59.950
<b>The Space Between What You Remember and What You’</b>re Told
